<title>POLAND: PROCHEM OCT NET SWINGS TO PLN 0.3 MLN PROFIT.</title>
<headline>PROCHEM OCT NET SWINGS TO PLN 0.3 MLN PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.34 vs   0.15 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.57 vs   0.45 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.69 vs   0.58 loss</p>
<p> Sales		    6.66 vs   4.33</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.78 vs   3.09</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.59 vs   4.22</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.62 vs   0.75</p>
<p> Sales		   32.99 vs  44.82</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish engineering company is Prochem</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
